flowchart TB
    startNode([A measure is filed]) --> reviewNode[Secretariat reviews and registers it]
    reviewNode --> committeeQ{Sent to a committee?}
    committeeQ -->|yes| referNode[Committee studies it and writes a report]
    committeeQ -->|no| agendaNode[Secretariat puts it on a session agenda]
    referNode --> agendaNode
    agendaNode --> callOrder[Presiding officer calls the session to order]
    callOrder --> rollCall[Secretariat records who is present]
    rollCall --> quorumNote[System shows if quorum is met - officer decides whether to proceed]
    quorumNote --> hearItem[Body hears the item: read, debate, maybe amend]
    hearItem --> motionNode[A member moves a motion]
    motionNode --> voteQ{Does this item need a vote?}
    voteQ -->|yes| openVote[Officer or secretariat opens voting]
    openVote --> castVote[Members vote yes, no, abstain, or inhibit]
    castVote --> closeVote[Officer or secretariat closes voting]
    closeVote --> nextItem{More agenda items?}
    voteQ -->|no| nextItem
    nextItem -->|yes| hearItem
    nextItem -->|no| adjournNode[Officer adjourns]
    adjournNode --> minutesDraft[System drafts minutes from the official record]
    minutesDraft --> minutesEdit[Secretariat edits and reviews the minutes]
    minutesEdit --> minutesFinal[Presiding officer approves and finalizes]
    minutesFinal --> publishQ{Release to the public?}
    publishQ -->|yes| publishNode[Secretariat publishes it]
    publishNode --> portalNode([Public can read it on the portal])
    publishQ -->|no| archiveNode([Kept internal and archived])
